+.note{color:#1f4fd1}
+</style></head><body>
+<!-- not counted: the brand mark and its name -->
+<header><div class="brand"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="24" height="24" rx="4" fill="#1f4fd1"/></svg><span>Northline Studios</span></div></header>
+<main>
+<h1>Rehearsal rooms by the hour</h1>
+<p>Five soundproofed rooms by the river, each with a PA, two amps and a full kit. Rooms open at 9:00 and close at 23:00; a booking holds the room for two hours, and you can move it until the day before.</p>
+<!-- not counted: links, and an outlined button -->
+<p>Read the <a href="#rules">house rules</a> before your first visit, or <a href="#map">find us on the map</a>.</p>
